Package: textworker
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: text transformation editor for V\OS
 TextWorker is a lightweight native text editor: edit text and apply
 transformations to it — case conversion (upper, lower, title), line
 sorting, trimming, prefix/suffix edits, find & replace with
 case-sensitivity and whole-word options, plus an undo history.
 Find and replace live in the sidebar.
